line	<col=000080>Go to a <col=800000>furnace</col> (closest is in Port Phasmatys, teleport to Falador, fairy ring to <col=800000>Zanaris</col>, amulet of glory to Al Kharid, or <col=800000>Home Teleport</col> to Lumbridge) and smelt a <col=800000>silver bar</col> into a <col=800000>conductor</col> (lightning rod).</col>
