line	<str>Talk to him again to give him the needle and thread.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Gardener Ghost for the shed key (ensure ghostspeak amulet is equipped).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cupboard inside the shed to get a garden brush.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take 3 canes from the pile of canes next to the shed</str>
line	
line	<str>Use all the canes (3) on the garden brush to get an extended brush (using a total of 3 bronze wires).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs to the western fireplace and use the extended brush on the fireplace for a conductor mould.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to a furnace (closest is in Port Phasmatys, teleport to Falador, fairy ring to Zanaris, amulet of glory to Al Kharid, or Home Teleport to Lumbridge) and smelt a silver bar into a conductor (lightning rod).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Return to the castle, go upstairs and then climb the southern ladder to reach the <col=800000>lightning conductor</col>.</col>
step	22	-	Quick guide step 22
line	<str>Start the quest by reading the signpost in the centre of Canifis or by talking to Dr Fenkenstrain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take a pickled brain off the table in the tavern in Canifis for 50gp, or by using Telekinetic Grab.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Dr Fenkenstrain inside of Fenkenstrain's Castle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs by the eastern or western staircase to the bookcases and read:</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click dig at the cross-shaped grave marker in the Haunted Woods, south-east of Fenkenstrain's castle and immediately east of fairy ring ALQ.</str>
line	
line	<str>Combine the decapicated head and the pickled brain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north out of the Haunted Woods and use your star amulet on the easternmost memorial (south-east of Fenkenstrain's castle).</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the memorial to enter the Experiment Cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inside, kill a level 51 Experiment for the cavern key. If you have started Rag and Bone Man II, kill additional Experiments (level 25) for the Experiment bone.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the north-western path to the end.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the chest and climb the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click Dig at the three graves to get the torso, arms and legs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Dr Fenkenstrain (Fenkenstrain's castle teleport) and give him the body parts.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again to give him the needle and thread.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Gardener Ghost for the shed key (ensure ghostspeak amulet is equipped).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cupboard inside the shed to get a garden brush.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take 3 canes from the pile of canes next to the shed</str>
line	
line	<str>Use all the canes (3) on the garden brush to get an extended brush (using a total of 3 bronze wires).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs to the western fireplace and use the extended brush on the fireplace for a conductor mould.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to a furnace (closest is in Port Phasmatys, teleport to Falador, fairy ring to Zanaris, amulet of glory to Al Kharid, or Home Teleport to Lumbridge) and smelt a silver bar into a conductor (lightning rod).</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the castle, go upstairs and then climb the southern ladder to reach the lightning conductor.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Repair the lightning conductor.</col>
